  "release_notes_md": "# v0.1.15 \u2014 Cosmetic hotfix: drop duplicate \"v\" prefix on Updates page\n\nTiny hotfix for a UI typo. The Selected release card title and several install confirm dialogs on System \u2192 Updates were rendering `vv0.1.13` (two `v`s) because the version string already includes the `v` prefix from the catalog. v0.1.15 strips the duplicate.\n\n## Affected text\n\n- Selected release card title (`Selected release \u00b7 v0.1.15`)\n- Install confirm modal title (`Install v0.1.15?` / `Install v0.1.15 from file?`)\n- \"What's in v0.1.15\" details panel inside the install confirm\n- Hotfix / air-gap / catalog install success messages\n- Downloaded release-notes filename (`aidatacollect-v0.1.15-release-notes.txt`)\n\nNo backend changes \u2014 portal-only.\n",
  "released_at": "2026-05-17T21:49:39Z",
